{"seq":1,"slug":"profiling-instrumentation-toolchain","title":"解释器性能观测：cProfile 插桩、py-spy/perf 采样与火焰图方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/optimization-diagnostics/profiling-instrumentation-toolchain","wordCount":2716,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"解释器性能观测-cprofile-插桩-py-spy-perf-采样与火焰图方法论\">解释器性能观测：cProfile 插桩、py-spy/perf 采样与火焰图方法论</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Python 的性能观测分成两条互斥的哲学路线，选错路线比选错工具更致命。<strong>确定性插桩（deterministic instrumentation）</strong> 在每次函数调用、返回、异常事件上挂钩子逐次计时，拿到精确的调用计数与自耗时，代价是每次调用都要跨过解释器与钩子之间的边界。<strong>统计采样（statistical sampling）</strong> 以固定频率抓取当前调用栈，按出现频次推断时间占比，精度受采样量限制，收益是对被测进程几乎零侵入。cProfile 属前者，py-spy 与 Linux <code>perf</code> 属后者，Scalene/pyinstrument 是采样路线的进阶实现（<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/profile.html\">Python <code>profile</code> 文档</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/benfred/py-spy\">py-spy</a>）。</p>\n<p>两条路线的取舍可以量化。采样的相对误差随命中次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>、总样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、目标时间占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = k/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 变化，热点的相对标准误近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RSE</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RSE} \\approx \\sqrt{\\frac{1-p}{p\\,n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.8856em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5544em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8856em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 py-spy 默认 100 Hz、10 秒负载为例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span>；占 5% 时间的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RSE</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>13.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RSE} \\approx 13.8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13.8%</span></span></span></span></span>——&quot;5% ± 0.7%&quot;这种结论只可信到数量级。压到 3% 以内需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 提高约 21 倍（<code>--rate</code> 调高或拉长采集窗口）。这就是采样剖面擅长回答&quot;谁是大头&quot;、不擅长回答&quot;这两个实现差 4%&quot;的原因。插桩则相反：一次调用产生固定开销 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{dispatch}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对调用次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的负载总开销是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot c_{dispatch}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，调用极密集的短函数反而比采样更贵。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q1{要精确调用次数&lt;br/&gt;或做回归对比?} --&gt;|是| CP[cProfile / pstats&lt;br/&gt;确定性插桩]&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|否| Q2{进程在跑&lt;br/&gt;且不能重启?}&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|是| PYS[py-spy record --pid&lt;br/&gt;进程外采样]&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{要看内核态&lt;br/&gt;或 native 栈?}&#10;  Q3 --&gt;|是| PERF[perf + Python trampoline&lt;br/&gt;-X perf]&#10;  Q3 --&gt;|否| SC[pyinstrument / Scalene&lt;br/&gt;进程内统计采样]&#10;  CP --&gt; FG[折叠栈 → 火焰图]&#10;  PYS --&gt; FG&#10;  PERF --&gt; FG&#10;  SC --&gt; FG\">graph TD\n  Q1{要精确调用次数&lt;br/&gt;或做回归对比?} --&gt;|是| CP[cProfile / pstats&lt;br/&gt;确定性插桩]\n  Q1 --&gt;|否| Q2{进程在跑&lt;br/&gt;且不能重启?}\n  Q2 --&gt;|是| PYS[py-spy record --pid&lt;br/&gt;进程外采样]\n  Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{要看内核态&lt;br/&gt;或 native 栈?}\n  Q3 --&gt;|是| PERF[perf + Python trampoline&lt;br/&gt;-X perf]\n  Q3 --&gt;|否| SC[pyinstrument / Scalene&lt;br/&gt;进程内统计采样]\n  CP --&gt; FG[折叠栈 → 火焰图]\n  PYS --&gt; FG\n  PERF --&gt; FG\n  SC --&gt; FG</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>采集对象</th>\n<th>侵入性</th>\n<th>附加到运行进程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>cProfile</td>\n<td>确定性插桩</td>\n<td>每次调用/返回/异常</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>py-spy</td>\n<td>采样（进程外读内存）</td>\n<td>调用栈快照</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>是（<code>--pid</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>perf + trampoline</td>\n<td>内核采样</td>\n<td>内核 + Python 帧</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pyinstrument</td>\n<td>采样（<code>PyEval_SetProfile</code>）</td>\n<td>调用栈，按 interval</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scalene</td>\n<td>采样 + 内存分配器</td>\n<td>行级 CPU/内存/拷贝量</td>\n<td>低（10–20%）</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cprofile-的确定性插桩与其代价\">cProfile 的确定性插桩与其代价</h2><p>cProfile 是标准库推荐的确定性 profiler，C 扩展实现，源自 lsprof。它监控<strong>每一次</strong>函数调用、返回与异常事件并给事件之间的区间计时（<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/profile.html\">Python <code>profile</code> 文档</a>）。命令行形式是 <code>python -m cProfile -o profile.out -s cumulative myscript.py</code>：<code>-o</code> 把原始数据落盘而不是打到 stdout，<code>-s</code> 只在没有 <code>-o</code> 时生效，<code>-m &lt;module&gt;</code> 自 3.7 起支持按模块剖析。落盘的 <code>.prof</code> 随后交给 <code>pstats</code> 排序、过滤、聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pstats&#10;from pstats import SortKey&#10;&#10;p = pstats.Stats(&quot;profile.out&quot;)&#10;p.strip_dirs().sort_stats(SortKey.CUMULATIVE).print_stats(15)&#10;p.print_callers(0.5, &quot;init&quot;)   # 先取前 50%，再过滤函数名含 init 的调用方\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pstats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pstats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SortKey</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pstats.Stats(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"profile.out\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p.strip_dirs().sort_stats(SortKey.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CUMULATIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).print_stats(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p.print_callers(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"init\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 先取前 50%，再过滤函数名含 init 的调用方</span></span></code></pre></div><p>报告列 <code>ncalls / tottime / percall / cumtime / percall / filename:lineno(function)</code> 里，<code>tottime</code> 是函数自身耗时，<code>cumtime</code> 含全部子调用；<code>3/1</code> 形式的 <code>ncalls</code> 表示总调用 3 次、其中原始（非递归）调用 1 次。注意 <strong><code>percall</code> 只是报告列，不是合法的排序键</strong>——合法键是 <code>calls</code>、<code>cumulative</code>、<code>tottime</code>、<code>pcalls</code>、<code>filename</code>、<code>name</code>、<code>nfl</code>、<code>line</code>、<code>stdname</code>，<code>print_stats</code> 自 3.13 起接受元组参数做多重排序。</p>\n<p>三个必须记住的坑：<strong>其一，cProfile 不能用来做基准测试。</strong> 它对 Python 层加开销、对 C 层不加，于是 C 代码在报告里显得相对更快——做基准请用 <code>timeit</code>。<strong>其二，底层时钟分辨率约 0.001 秒</strong>，单次测量不可能更细，另有&quot;profiler 派发延迟&quot;这一独立误差源。<strong>其三，<code>.prof</code> 文件格式不保证跨版本、跨 profiler、跨操作系统兼容</strong>，它不是稳定的数据交换格式。</p>\n<p>CPython 3.12 起的生力军是 <code>sys.monitoring</code>（PEP 669），以 PEP 659 的特化（quickening）为基础，只在实际需要时把字节码替换成带插桩的版本，并支持按工具 ID（<code>PROFILER_ID = 2</code>）、按 code 对象开启事件、用返回 <code>DISABLE</code> 关闭热点位置（<a href=\"https://peps.python.org/pep-0669/\">PEP 669</a>）。PEP 669 原文并未宣称 cProfile 已迁移其上，但 <code>LINE</code> 与 <code>INSTRUCTION</code> 两档事件的内存代价很可观——单工具下 <code>LINE</code> 约 +40%、<code>INSTRUCTION</code> 约 +80%。事件粒度与钩子开销的实测对照见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../interpreter-bytecode-execution/frame-locals-exception-unwinding\">局部变量、异常展开与栈回溯</a>：同一负载下 <code>settrace</code> 5.5×、<code>setprofile</code> 1.3×、<code>monitoring(PY_START)</code> 测不出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"py-spy-与采样剖面-进程外读取与-gil-视角\">py-spy 与采样剖面：进程外读取与 GIL 视角</h2><p>py-spy 是 Rust 实现的采样 profiler，它<strong>不进入被测进程</strong>，而是直接读取目标进程内存：Linux 用 <code>process_vm_readv</code>，macOS 用 <code>vm_read</code>，Windows 用 <code>ReadProcessMemory</code>，据此遍历解释器线程与帧结构重建调用栈；符号被剥离时回退到 BSS 扫描（<a href=\"https://github.com/benfred/py-spy\">py-spy</a>）。这条路径决定了它的三个特征：<strong>不需要改代码、不需要重启、可以附加到已经在跑的进程</strong>——也决定了它在容器里需要额外权限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"py-spy record -o profile.svg --pid 12345          # 附加到运行中进程，输出火焰图 SVG&#10;py-spy top --pid 12345                            # 类 top 的实时视图，含 %GIL&#10;py-spy dump --pid 12345 --locals                  # 打印各线程当前栈（含帧局部变量）&#10;py-spy record -o api.svg --subprocesses -- python -m gunicorn app:app\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">py-spy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> profile.svg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --pid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12345</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 附加到运行中进程，输出火焰图 SVG</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">py-spy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> top</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --pid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12345</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                            # 类 top 的实时视图，含 %GIL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">py-spy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dump</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --pid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12345</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --locals</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  # 打印各线程当前栈（含帧局部变量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">py-spy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api.svg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --subprocesses</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gunicorn</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app:app</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个 flag 直接对应三类诊断：<code>--gil</code> 只采样持有 GIL 的线程，用来区分&quot;线程在等 GIL&quot;与&quot;线程在算&quot;；<code>--idle</code> 纳入 profiler 默认判为 idle 的帧（idle 判定靠 OS 信号加启发式）；<code>--nonblocking</code> 从不暂停目标进程，代价是可能出现采样错误或残缺帧。<code>--native</code> 会把 C/C++/Cython 扩展一并纳入，但依赖平台且建议带符号。支持面是 CPython 2.3–2.7 与 3.3–3.14，暂不支持 32 位 Windows 与 PyPy。</p>\n<p>权限是生产环境最常见的拦路虎：macOS 上附加<strong>一律需要 root/sudo</strong>，且 SIP 阻止剖析 <code>/usr/bin/python</code>；Linux 上用 <code>--pid</code> 附加通常要 root，从命令行启动新模式一般不需要；Docker/Kubernetes 里需要给容器加 <code>SYS_PTRACE</code>。<strong>&quot;采样器零开销所以可以常开&quot;是错误的推广</strong>——它的成本在权限与页表遍历上，不在 CPU 占比上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"linux-perf-与-cpython-的-trampoline\">Linux perf 与 CPython 的 trampoline</h2><p><code>perf</code> 只看得到原生 C 符号，默认情况下所有 Python 调用都塌缩到同一个 <code>_PyEval_EvalFrameDefault</code> 里，毫无区分度。CPython 3.12 起在<strong>部分架构、仅 Linux</strong> 上提供了 trampoline 支持：每次 Python 函数调用前插入一小段动态编译的跳板，并通过 perf map 文件把跳板地址映射回 Python 函数，于是 <code>perf report</code> 里就能出现 <code>py::foo:/src/script.py</code> 这样的符号（<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/howto/perf_profiling.html\">Python perf profiling howto</a>）。</p>\n<p>开启方式有三档，优先级为 <code>sys.activate_stack_trampoline()</code> &gt; <code>python -X perf</code> &gt; 环境变量 <code>PYTHONPERFSUPPORT</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"PYTHONPERFSUPPORT=1 perf record -F 9999 -g -o perf.data python my_script.py&#10;perf report -g -i perf.data\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PYTHONPERFSUPPORT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 9999</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> perf.data</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_script.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> report</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> perf.data</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import sys&#10;sys.activate_stack_trampoline(&quot;perf&quot;)   # 只对关心的代码段开启&#10;do_profiled_stuff()&#10;sys.deactivate_stack_trampoline()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sys</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sys.activate_stack_trampoline(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"perf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只对关心的代码段开启</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">do_profiled_stuff()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sys.deactivate_stack_trampoline()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>先用 <code>python -m sysconfig | grep HAVE_PERF_TRAMPOLINE</code> 确认构建支持。要拿到可靠基于帧指针的栈展开，解释器须以 <code>-fno-omit-frame-pointer -mno-omit-leaf-frame-pointer</code> 编译（<code>python -m sysconfig | grep &#39;no-omit-frame-pointer&#39;</code> 可查）。没有帧指针时可用 JIT 辅助展开（<code>PYTHON_PERF_JIT_SUPPORT</code> 或 <code>python -X perf_jit</code>），但开销更高且需要额外的 <code>perf inject --jit</code> 步骤。<code>perf</code> 的独特价值在于：<strong>它是唯一能同时把内核态（syscall、页错误、调度延迟）与 Python 帧放进同一份剖面的工具</strong>，这正是回答&quot;CPU 到底花在用户态还是被内核吃掉了&quot;所需要的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"火焰图方法论-宽度是频次-不是时间轴\">火焰图方法论：宽度是频次，不是时间轴</h2><p>火焰图（Flame Graph）由 Brendan Gregg 提出，初衷是解决函数级插桩的开销与可读性问题：他改用定时采样后，&quot;砍掉了时间轴、重排样本以最大化帧合并&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.brendangregg.com/flamegraphs.html\">Brendan Gregg — Flame Graphs</a>）。流程是先把采样的调用栈**折叠（fold）**聚合——相同调用路径合并计数——再渲染为可交互 SVT。</p>\n<p>读图规则只有几条，但误读极其普遍：<strong>x 轴是栈样本总量、按字母序排列，不是时间的流逝</strong>；y 轴是栈深度，从底部 0 起算；每个矩形是一个栈帧；<strong>矩形越宽，表示它出现在越多采样栈里</strong>；顶边是 on-CPU 的部分，其下是它的祖先。对 CPU 剖面，宽度即采样频次，也就是该采样率下 CPU 时间的代理量。</p>\n<p>由此推出三条最常见的误读。<strong>其一，从左到右不表示执行顺序</strong>——把时间放 x 轴的是 flame chart，Gregg 明确指出有些工具输出了它却&quot;错误地叫它火焰图&quot;。<strong>其二，宽度不是独占自耗时</strong>——一个塔状帧的宽度包含其后代做的工作，要看自耗时得看插桩型 profiler 的 <code>tottime</code>。<strong>其三，颜色通常不编码量级</strong>——原始设计用随机色只为区分相邻帧。倒置的 icicle 图是同一份数据竖向反转，含义不变。</p>\n<p>还有一条推论：<strong>度量对象不一定是 CPU</strong>。内存火焰图用字节数而非 CPU 样本作宽度，memray 的 <code>flamegraph</code> 报告正是如此——它追踪 Python 代码、原生扩展模块与解释器自身的分配，<code>--native</code> 会追加 C/C++ 帧并用不同颜色标出（<a href=\"https://github.com/bloomberg/memray\">memray</a>）。memray 不是采样器，它&quot;追踪每一次函数调用&quot;以保证调用栈准确，因此更慢（开 <code>--native</code> 尤甚），只支持 Linux 与 macOS、Python 3.9+。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择与组合-开销预算与生产接入\">选择与组合：开销预算与生产接入</h2><p>把工具按&quot;你付什么、你换什么&quot;排开，选择就清楚了。<strong>pyinstrument</strong> 是基于 <code>PyEval_SetProfile</code> 的统计 profiler，<code>--interval</code> 默认 0.001 秒，输出支持 console 树、交互 HTML、speedscope 与 <code>pstats</code>（可回灌进 cProfile 工具链）（<a href=\"https://github.com/joerick/pyinstrument\">pyinstrument</a>）。<strong>Scalene</strong> 用采样而非插桩，典型开销&quot;不超过 10–20%（常常更低）&quot;，并能把 Python 代码时间与 native/C/C++ 库时间分开、报告每行内存增长与每秒拷贝的 MB 数——后者专治 NumPy 与 Python 之间的隐式转换（<a href=\"https://github.com/plasma-umass/scalene\">Scalene</a>），Windows 内存剖析要 Scalene 2.0 起。</p>\n<p>一个可操作的决策表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的问题</th>\n<th>选它</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>这个函数被调了多少次、自耗时多少</td>\n<td>cProfile + pstats</td>\n<td>唯一给出精确调用计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线上进程卡住了，不能重启</td>\n<td>py-spy <code>dump</code> / <code>record --pid</code></td>\n<td>进程外附加，极低侵入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程到底在算还是在等 GIL</td>\n<td>py-spy <code>top</code> / <code>record --gil</code></td>\n<td>直接给出 %GIL 与持锁线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 被内核还是用户态吃掉</td>\n<td>perf + <code>-X perf</code></td>\n<td>一份剖面覆盖内核与 Python 帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哪个对象在涨、谁分配的</td>\n<td>memray</td>\n<td>追踪每次分配，非采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是 Python 慢还是 numpy 慢</td>\n<td>Scalene</td>\n<td>分离 Python 与 native 时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产接入的顺序建议反着来：<strong>先采样定位（py-spy/perf，成本近零），再插桩确认（cProfile/pstats，付调用级开销）</strong>。反过来做，你会先花几天优化一个被插桩开销放大出来的假热点。压缩观测成本的通用手段与 <code>monitoring</code> 一节同源：提高事件粒度、把探针限定在关心的 code 对象上、在热点位置用 <code>DISABLE</code> 关闭——<code>--nonblocking</code> 之于 py-spy、<code>--gil</code> 过滤之于采样，都是同一思路在工具层的体现。GIL 释放形态如何决定采样结果与真实 CPU 时间的偏差，见 <a href=\"../gil-concurrency-runtime/gil-design-switching-cost\">GIL 设计原理：全局锁语义、切换检查点与 sys.setswitchinterval 的代价模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>两条路线先分清楚</strong>：cProfile 是确定性插桩（精确计数、调用级开销），py-spy/perf/Scalene 是统计采样（低侵入、精度受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 限制）。选路线比选工具更重要。</li>\n<li><strong>采样精度是算出来的</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RSE</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RSE} \\approx \\sqrt{(1-p)/(p\\,n)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，100 Hz、10 秒负载下 5% 的热点只能信到 13.8% 量级；要区分小差异就加样本或换插桩。</li>\n<li><strong>cProfile 不是基准工具</strong>：它对 Python 加开销、对 C 不加，会让 C 代码显得更快；时钟分辨率约 0.001 秒，<code>.prof</code> 格式不跨版本兼容。</li>\n<li><strong>py-spy 的成本在权限不在 CPU</strong>：进程外读内存，<code>--pid</code> 在 macOS 要 root、容器要 <code>SYS_PTRACE</code>；<code>--gil</code>/<code>--idle</code>/<code>--nonblocking</code>/<code>--subprocesses</code> 各解一类诊断。</li>\n<li><strong>perf 需要 trampoline</strong>：3.12+ 在 Linux 部分架构上用 <code>-X perf</code> / <code>PYTHONPERFSUPPORT</code> 把 Python 函数暴露给 <code>perf report</code>，是唯一同时覆盖内核态与 Python 帧的剖面。</li>\n<li><strong>火焰图宽度是频次不是时间</strong>：x 轴按字母序、y 轴是深度、颜色不编码量级；把时间放 x 轴的是 flame chart。</li>\n<li><strong>组合而非二选一</strong>：先采样定位大头，再插桩确认计数，内存问题换 memray，Python/native 混淆换 Scalene。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"解释器性能观测：cProfile 插桩、py-spy/perf 采样与火焰图方法论","id":"解释器性能观测-cprofile-插桩-py-spy-perf-采样与火焰图方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"cProfile 的确定性插桩与其代价","id":"cprofile-的确定性插桩与其代价"},{"level":2,"text":"py-spy 与采样剖面：进程外读取与 GIL 视角","id":"py-spy-与采样剖面-进程外读取与-gil-视角"},{"level":2,"text":"Linux perf 与 CPython 的 trampoline","id":"linux-perf-与-cpython-的-trampoline"},{"level":2,"text":"火焰图方法论：宽度是频次，不是时间轴","id":"火焰图方法论-宽度是频次-不是时间轴"},{"level":2,"text":"选择与组合：开销预算与生产接入","id":"选择与组合-开销预算与生产接入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"循环引用与分代 GC：traverse/弱引用协议、gc 代际参数调优与对象泄漏定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/memory-object-model/refcycle-gc-generational-traverse"},"next":{"title":"内存增长诊断：tracemalloc 快照差分、对象统计、RSS 与堆对象偏差定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/optimization-diagnostics/memory-leak-diagnostics-tracemalloc"}}